<div id="p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:144%;">NeuroRAD-FM: A Foundation Model for Neuro-Oncology with Distributionally Robust Training
</span></p>
</div>
<div id="p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">Moinak Bhattacharya<sup id="p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_sup">a</sup>, Angelica P. Kurtz<sup id="p2.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup">b</sup>, Fabio M. Iwamoto<sup id="p2.1.1.3" class="ltx_sup">c</sup>, Prateek Prasanna*<sup id="p2.1.1.4" class="ltx_sup">a</sup>, Gagandeep Singh*<sup id="p2.1.1.5" class="ltx_sup">b</sup></span></p>
</div>
<div id="p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p3.1" class="ltx_p"><sup id="p3.1.1" class="ltx_sup">a</sup>Department of Biomedical Informatics, Stony Brook University, Stony Brook, NY, USA</p>
</div>
<div id="p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p4.1" class="ltx_p"><sup id="p4.1.1" class="ltx_sup">b</sup>Department of Radiology, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, NY, USA</p>
</div>
<div id="p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p5.1" class="ltx_p"><sup id="p5.1.1" class="ltx_sup">c</sup>Department of Neuro-Oncology, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, NY, USA</p>
</div>
<div id="p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Corresponding Author:</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Prateek Prasanna, PhD 
<br class="ltx_break">Stony Brook University 
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
